libsdxi 0.1.0
==============

Initial public preview release of the local userspace C library for the SDXI
Linux software stack.

Highlights:
- public headers under `libsdxi.h`, `sdxi/`, and `sdxi/vendor/`
- local device discovery, open, capability, attribute, key, context, and
  dataplane helper APIs
- AMD QoS helpers and AMD S1/S2 crypto helpers under
  `sdxi/vendor/amd_crypto.h`
- autotools packaging with pkg-config metadata, man pages, examples, and a
  distcheck-validated release tarball
